title: Plots and preparations.
subtitle: The preparations are in order, we just need the approval
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: 1
view-if: operations_scene = 1
on-arrival: operations_scene = 0;

= Plots and preparations

Partners: [+ assassination_partners_string +]

It's too late to turn back now...

These are our current estimates of loyalty within the police, if any of the 2 are disloyal it *will* lead to disaster. 

[? if assassination_partners == "Police" or assassination_partners == "Prussian" or assassination_partners == "Reichsbanner" : Current interior police loyalty: [+ interior_police_loyalty : loyalty +]. [? if interior_police_loyalty < interior_police_loyalty_plot_cap: The police show frighteningly low levels of loyalty. ?] ?]

[? if assassination_partners == "Prussian" or assassination_partners == "Reichsbanner" : Current prussian police loyalty: [+ prussian_police_loyalty : loyalty +]. [? if prussian_police_loyalty < prussian_police_loyalty_plot_cap: The Prussian police seem untrustworthy. ?] ?]

[? if assassination_partners == "Reichsbanner" : Current Reichsbanner dissent: [+ rb_dissent +]% [? if rb_dissent >= rb_dissent_plot_cap: The Reichsbanner seem unwilling. ?] ?]

- @go: Operation Reversed Scale is given the go ahead.
- @bribe: For extra measure.

@go
subtitle: Operation Reversed Scale is given the go ahead. [? if chancellor == "Braun": "Who made that mess?" "Braun, are you ok?" "Sorry." ?].
on-arrival: {!

if (Q.interior_police_loyalty >= Q.interior_police_loyalty_plot_cap && Q.assassination_partners == "Police" ) {
    Q[Q.plotMap[Q.plot_target]] = "successful";
} else if (Q.interior_police_loyalty >= Q.interior_police_loyalty_plot_cap && Q.prussian_police_loyalty >= Q.prussian_police_loyalty_plot_cap && Q.assassination_partners == "Prussian") {
    Q[Q.plotMap[Q.plot_target]] = "successful";
} else if (Q.interior_police_loyalty >= Q.interior_police_loyalty_plot_cap && Q.prussian_police_loyalty >= Q.prussian_police_loyalty_plot_cap && Q.rb_dissent < Q.rb_dissent_plot_cap && Q.assassination_partners == "Reichsbanner") {
    Q[Q.plotMap[Q.plot_target]] = "successful";
} else if (Q.assassination_partners == "Spies") {
    Q[Q.plotMap[Q.plot_target]] = "successful";
} else {
    Q[Q.plotMap[Q.plot_target]] = "failed";
}

!}

@bribe
subtitle: -1 budget. Promise a pay raise well after the assisnation attempt.
choose-if: budget > 0
on-arrival: interior_police_loyalty *= 1.5; prussian_police_loyalty *= 1.5; budget -=1; barmat +=1; {!

if (Q.interior_police_loyalty >= Q.interior_police_loyalty_plot_cap && Q.assassination_partners == "Police" ) {
    Q[Q.plotMap[Q.plot_target]] = "successful";
} else if (Q.interior_police_loyalty >= Q.interior_police_loyalty_plot_cap && Q.prussian_police_loyalty >= Q.prussian_police_loyalty_plot_cap && Q.assassination_partners == "Prussian") {
    Q[Q.plotMap[Q.plot_target]] = "successful";
} else if (Q.interior_police_loyalty >= Q.interior_police_loyalty_plot_cap && Q.prussian_police_loyalty >= Q.prussian_police_loyalty_plot_cap && Q.rb_dissent < Q.rb_dissent_plot_cap && Q.assassination_partners == "Reichsbanner") {
    Q[Q.plotMap[Q.plot_target]] = "successful";
} else if (Q.assassination_partners == "Spies") {
    Q[Q.plotMap[Q.plot_target]] = "successful";
} else {
    Q[Q.plotMap[Q.plot_target]] = "failed";
}

!}